== 2. neutral metapopulations against the exact recursion ==
N = 50 diploids per deme, 20 loci, 1 mutations per chromosome per generation, V_m = 0.001
Predictions use migrate!'s own law of pairs' origins, estimated from 40,000 calls in 4 batches;
their SE (from the batches) is combined with the simulation's in z. 'pool' is the prediction with
independent origins (the textbook island model), shown for comparison.
