== 3. the moments lowering (run_moments, k demes, migration_mixing, erosion) ==
island k=4 Nm=1.0, generation 2499: moments V_G within 0.1 (exact expectation 0.4043), variance among deme means 0 (exact 0.1545)
The moments lowering is deterministic: deme means that start equal stay equal, so it has no between-deme
variance, and erosion removes V_G/(2N) per deme without the variance migrants bring back from other demes;
its within-deme fixed point is an isolated deme's 2N·V_m, not the metapopulation's 2Nk·V_m.

41 comparisons; max |z| = 2.57
PASS: every |z| < 4.0
